# 基本図形編集のプロセスの倍率を、元の仮身に書き戻す (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py:
# figproc 1 makes every figure open with the process. Two figures of 30 rectangles (A, B)
# are linked into BTRON; A is opened from its link (the process P), the link of B copied in
# BTRON and pasted into A, and B opened from its link in A (another process). In B the
# 倍率 palette (under the button at 332,48 of its 道具パネル) is brought up and x2 chosen:
# the figure is drawn twice as large, scrolled home. B closed, its view goes to P, which
# writes zoom 200 into the link in its record.
# Keys with Ctrl (01): C 06, V 19, E 08; Esc 29.
mkbig fig 30 4
figproc 1
linkbig 180 45
mkbig fig 30 4
linkbig 180 95
wait 300
click 230 104
wait 300
key 06 01
wait 300
logmark
dclick 190 52
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
key 19 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 33 shapes 1 picked
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
dclick 340 221
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 1200
logmark
click 332 48
expectsince figure: palette 6 open
wait 500
shot zoom_palette
click 704 95
expectsince figure: zoom 200
wait 300
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 6 closed
wait 500
shot zoom_x2
logmark
key 08 01
expectsincein 30 figure: link view written back: 0,0 zoom 200
wait 500
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
figproc 0
